I'd like to see the scrollbar make a return, however perhaps this may help you?

```
"tui": {
  "scroll_acceleration": {
    "enabled": true
  }
}
```

Still involves using the mousewheel but it does make the process a bit nicer.

Another, hopefully more targeted, possible workaround is to disable the title agent:
```
"agent": {
    "title": {
      "disable": true
    }
  },
```
However that, too, will result in a generic session name not reflecting the initial user prompt.

